# Lampose Partner (Food-Partner) — environment variables
# Copy to `.env` and fill in your own values. `.env` is gitignored.

# Backend API base URL. No trailing slash and no version suffix — the app
# appends the versioned paths itself. The one Lampose backend listens on 5001.
#
# LEAVE IT EMPTY to run the whole onboarding flow locally with no server: the
# application is logged to the console instead of posted, exactly as the
# website's food-partner module does today. There is no endpoint for it yet.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
